{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're broke, out of work and tired of couch surfing. It's time to <strong>take matters</strong> into your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Buenos Aires, Argentina -- where <strong>land and labor are yours</strong>, and every brick laid brings you closer to building the life you've always wanted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with noting but a shovel and a <strong>dream</strong>, and construct your house from the ground up in the dusty outskirts of Buenos Aires. <strong>Gather materials</strong>, pour your own concrete and build every wall with your own <strong>two hands</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/b2e22b5062f3bdf4cb1572c338e8b6af.poster.avif?t=1754515507\" width=700 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/b2e22b5062f3bdf4cb1572c338e8b6af.webm?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/b2e22b5062f3bdf4cb1572c338e8b6af.mp4?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece counts. From digging trenches to placing bricks one by one, you'll handle every stage of construction yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/e958a3b845d6b24f2ee786ba931fae40.poster.avif?t=1754515507\" width=700 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/e958a3b845d6b24f2ee786ba931fae40.webm?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/e958a3b845d6b24f2ee786ba931fae40.mp4?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take breaks to enjoy the simple things: a sunrise, a mate and a Saturn. But don't get too comfortable, because the work never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/4a3eefb69fb4d5e948059697a2f2e873.poster.avif?t=1754515507\" width=700 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/4a3eefb69fb4d5e948059697a2f2e873.webm?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/4a3eefb69fb4d5e948059697a2f2e873.mp4?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find work wherever you can to fund your dream, like hauling and delivering water tanks to local houses. Clients don't want to move, they prefer to enjoy their Quil beer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/e631dbd6dca1022a498aea3e62b645ad.poster.avif?t=1754515507\" width=700 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/e631dbd6dca1022a498aea3e62b645ad.webm?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/e631dbd6dca1022a498aea3e62b645ad.mp4?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your house will not build itself, after working you will have to buy materials to continue building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/616978b0f432e881f4dae1846ebbc2a6.poster.avif?t=1754515507\" width=700 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/616978b0f432e881f4dae1846ebbc2a6.webm?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/616978b0f432e881f4dae1846ebbc2a6.mp4?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dare dirt to a home with walls, windows and a roof you built yourself -- this is <strong>your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/0b2205b4d76b0f765f5ed889cf9b04c3.poster.avif?t=1754515507\" width=700 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/0b2205b4d76b0f765f5ed889cf9b04c3.webm?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/extras/0b2205b4d76b0f765f5ed889cf9b04c3.mp4?t=1754515507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819930?t=1754515507","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819930?t=1754515507","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/fa6bb1f709e0c1ab0028302e0710026a2bc65633/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754515507","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819930/fa6bb1f709e0c1ab0028302e0710026a2bc65633/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754515507","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descripti